# Secrets the Forgejo chart renders that hold no secret (bin/artifact refuses any other). The DB and mailer
# passwords reach the pod through env from forgejo-security, forgejo-mailer and s3-cnpg-forgejo, encrypted beside.
forgejo-inline-config  app.ini by section: hosts, paths, feature flags; no password, no key
forgejo                config_environment.sh and the assertions the init runs
forgejo-init           the init scripts: directories, gpg, ssh signing, configure_gitea.sh
